<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian shares correct, ending eight-day bull run.</title>
<headline>Austrian shares correct, ending eight-day bull run.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian shares end almost one percent weaker on Thursday, but off the day's low of 1,377.26. Traders foresee further correction before any new attempt on the upside.</p>
<p>*ATX down 14.10 points or 1.01 percent at 1,385.30</p>
<p>*13 losers outweigh eight gainers</p>
<p>*Top gainer microchip maker AMS, up 1.42 pct at 1,075 ats</p>
<p>*Top loser beverages group BBAG, down 4.90 pct at 795 ats</p>
<p>*July ATX future down 14.1 points at 1,394</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
